<title>USA: U-Ship names chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>U-Ship names chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>U-Ship Inc said Thursday it named Anwar Bhimani as vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The chief financial officer post is a new one at the company.</p>
<p>He was most recently chief financial officer and corporate secretary for Legal Research Center Inc.</p>
<p>&quot;The hiring of a chief financial officer completes the building of our management team,&quot; Bruce Senske, chief executive officer, said in a statement.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
